From 72067026d0df0372cc0a9a8a5c819820fd73e997 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ReArc Overlay <overlay@rearc.invalid>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 09:57:39 +0400
Subject: [PATCH] P-TAB-001 wave 18c: expose page context menus and native
 commands

Forward sanitized ContextMenuParams from the browser-less view delegate to deferred host events, retain weak-document identity and cancel stale requests. Dispatch link/edit/image/navigation commands through Chromium; SaveFrameWithHeaders retains image download context and referrer policy. No menu is rendered by Chromium. Inspect returns unsupported because DevToolsWindow requires Browser UI. ABI 1.21 / bridge 0.23.0. Builds p60-p61; native context host covers payload, link/edit/navigation commands and cancellation. Full image-command runtime evidence follows in the wave report.

Last rebased: 2026-11-04 onto Chromium 156.0.8078.74 (d331de35ca).

Co-Authored-By: Codex <noreply@openai.com>
